                   rdfs:comment "The defender position."@en ;
                   rdfs:label "Defender"@en .


###  http://example.org/tsl-ontology#forward_position
:forward_position rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           :Forward ;
                  rdfs:comment "The forward position."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Forward"@en .


###  http://example.org/tsl-ontology#goalkeeper_position
